{"lauren:How about meeting at the centre at one? We can avoid the rain and Sam can stay for a while. It is also near the station for Jo. I can bring sandwiches. Does that work for everyone?":"c6df9f0779b3ca1d5ea5d9ad95bc0fb35f6e3e2dd76358993abbc95c2d904af5","lauren:They're waiting outside.":"47b0447440641b3737a066eb025503b323f904acf9f7237fd869841d63136a9a","lauren:I cook dinner at night.":"8d4364d8cfae92a863955e6e3b879553dc39288e914811014d67464479ce6aaf","lauren:I'm doing great, thanks for asking.":"703a230a1162b87453147c452f2a5117666c723b602c6c8d5b748dff4a31ca95","lauren:The cost of living is high.":"8a4ec0ba7f5aa009f4eccb14826f5e000efe77dba7e2f9ad11b3cac466b23483"}